## WP2 – Electrospinning Under Controlled Environmental Conditions

### Tasks

- Prepare polymer solutions.
- Operate electrospinning equipment.
- Fabricate samples under controlled humidity conditions.
- Investigate the effects of:
- Relative humidity
- Applied voltage
- Flow rate
- Tip-to-collector distance
- Polymer concentration

### Deliverables

- Library of electrospun samples.
- Process logbook containing all fabrication conditions.

